<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Jan 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark Jan 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Bank, Dresdner Bank and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    03.JAN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.981    PAY DATE  S-23.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.50     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
